&\mathrm{tp}_\mathcal{M}(a, a'') = \mathrm{tp}_\mathcal{M}(a, a^*) \text{ and } \mathrm{tp}_\mathcal{M}(a', a'') = \mathrm{tp}_\mathcal{M}(a', a^*).
